<view class="page">
  <view class="card upload-card">
    <view class="up-icon"></view>
    <view class="section-title">上传作业（仅照片）</view>
    <view class="muted">拍照或选图直接提交，不分科目。AI 每次上线会自动识别科目并分析，结果更新到「掌握情况」。处理完即清理云端原图（本地留底）。</view>
    <button class="btn-primary up-btn" bindtap="chooseAndUpload" loading="{{uploading}}">拍照 / 选图上传</button>
    <view class="muted center" style="margin-top:10rpx;">仅支持照片，不支持视频</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{list.length}}">
    <view class="section-title">提交记录</view>
    <view class="rec" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="_id">
      <view class="rec-left">
        <view class="rec-status status-{{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.timeText}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="rec-right" wx:if="{{item.status==='done' && item.subject}}">
        <view class="muted">AI 识别：{{item.subjectName}}</view>
        <view class="fix-btn" bindtap="correct" data-id="{{item._id}}">看错了？</view>
      </view>
      <view class="rec-right" wx:elif="{{item.status==='rejected_irrelevant'}}">
        <view class="muted">非作业内容已忽略</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!list.length}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-emoji"></view>
    <view class="muted">还没有提交记录，上传第一张试试</view>
  </view>
</view>
